Third-party software
--------------------
Plumbgraph links against open-source crates, including tree-sitter and the
tree-sitter-{python,javascript,typescript,rust} grammars (MIT), rusqlite and
SQLite (MIT / public domain), ureq and rustls (Apache-2.0 / MIT / ISC), clap,
serde, regex, rayon and others. Their licenses are enforced in CI with
`cargo deny` (see deny.toml). Run `cargo deny list` for the full list.

Ideas and prior art acknowledged (no code copied): vulture's confidence model,
knip, aider's repo-map, stack-graphs, SCIP, ast-grep.
